msgid "Route 1"
msgstr "Route 1"

msgid "Au sud : Bourg-Ludo."
msgstr "South: Bourg-Ludo."



msgid "La montagne est droit devant."
msgstr "The mountain is straight ahead."

msgid "Vous trouvez un Antidote !"
msgstr "You found an Antidote!"

msgid "Vous rangez l'Antidote dans la poche Objets."
msgstr "You put the Antidote in the Items pocket."

msgid "Vous trouvez un Rappel !"
msgstr "You found a Revive!"

msgid "Vous rangez le Rappel dans la poche Objets."
msgstr "You put the Revive in the Items pocket."

msgid "Vous trouvez une Super Potion !"
msgstr "You found a Super Potion!"

msgid "Vous rangez la Super Potion dans la poche Objets."
msgstr "You put the Super Potion in the Items pocket."





msgid "D'ici, on voit la rivière se séparer en trois."
msgstr "From here, you can see the river split in three."

msgid "Par temps clair, on devine même le toit du laboratoire."
msgstr "On a clear day, you can even make out the lab's roof."

msgid "La route continue vers la montagne."
msgstr "The road goes on towards the mountain."

msgid "Vous trouvez une Eau Fraîche !"
msgstr "You found a Fresh Water!"

msgid "Vous rangez l'Eau Fraîche dans la poche Objets."
msgstr "You put the Fresh Water in the Items pocket."

msgid "Cet arbre semble pouvoir être coupé !"
msgstr "This tree looks like it can be cut down!"

msgid "Ce rebord de roche ne se remonte pas."
msgstr "You can't climb back up this rocky ledge."

msgid "Pour aller au nord, il faut faire le tour par les hautes herbes."
msgstr "To head north, you have to go around through the tall grass."

msgid "Les Pokémon de la route sont plus vifs que ceux de l'île."
msgstr "The Pokémon on the road are livelier than the island's."

msgid "J'en ai vu un filer entre mes jambes !"
msgstr "I saw one dart right between my legs!"

msgid "Route de l'est."
msgstr "East Road."

msgid "Le chemin n'est pas encore tracé."
msgstr "The path isn't laid out yet."

msgid "La rivière a creusé son lit bien en dessous de nous."
msgstr "The river has dug its bed far below us."

msgid "Aucun sentier n'y descend : il faut prendre les ponts."
msgstr "No trail goes down there: you have to take the bridges."

msgid "D'ici, on voit les poissons remonter le courant."
msgstr "From here, you can watch the fish swim upstream."

msgid "Dommage qu'on ne puisse pas descendre jusqu'à l'eau."
msgstr "Too bad there's no way down to the water."

msgid "La route continue vers l'est."
msgstr "The road goes on to the east."

msgid "Krr... Krapince !"
msgstr "Krr... Corphish!"

msgid "Koki... yas !"
msgstr "Shell... der!"

msgid "Joli ! Joliflor !"
msgstr "Bell! Bellossom!"

msgid "Le premier au bout de la plage a gagné !"
msgstr "First one to the end of the beach wins!"

msgid "Pousse-toi, pousse-toi !"
msgstr "Out of the way, out of the way!"

msgid "Attends-moi ! Tu es parti avant le signal !"
msgstr "Wait for me! You left before the signal!"

msgid "Écrapince"
msgstr "Corphish"

msgid "Kokiyas"
msgstr "Shellder"

msgid "Joliflor"
msgstr "Bellossom"

msgid "Musique"
msgstr "Music"

msgid "Cris des Pokémon"
msgstr "Pokémon cries"

msgid "Autres sons"
msgstr "Other sounds"
